{
  "info": {
    "name": "Mustan Healthcare Pharmacy — API",
    "description": "Every endpoint on the pharmacy API.\n\nRun **Auth & health → Login** first — it sets the mhp_session cookie that every other request needs, and Postman keeps it automatically. **Sign out** is the last folder on purpose: running it early ends the session for everything below.\n\nRequests that need an id read it from a collection variable, populated by the list requests earlier in each folder. Run a folder top to bottom and the ids fill themselves in.\n\nMoney is an integer number of kobo throughout: 80000 is ₦800.00.\n\nThe write requests really do change the database — they create a product, receive stock, ring up a sale and add a user. Run `pnpm seed` afterwards to put the shop back to its clean state.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
